  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"zh\">\n <p>\n  <b>\n   Ap和Bp星\n  </b>\n  是A型和B型\n  <a href=\"/wiki/%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E6%81%86%E6%98%9F\" title=\"特殊恆星\">\n   特殊恆星\n  </a>\n  （因此註記為p），光譜中顯是其\n  <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/%E7%A8%80%E5%9C%9F%E9%87%91%E5%B1%AC\" title=\"稀土金屬\">\n   稀土金屬\n  </a>\n  元素（像是\n  <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/%E9%8A%AA\" title=\"銪\">\n   銪\n  </a>\n  、\n  <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/%E9%90%A0\" title=\"鐠\">\n   鐠\n  </a>\n  和\n  <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/%E9%87%B9\" title=\"釹\">\n   釹\n  </a>\n  等），以及\n  <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/%E9%8D%B6\" title=\"鍶\">\n   鍶\n  </a>\n  、\n  <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/%E9%89%BB\" title=\"鉻\">\n   鉻\n  </a>\n  等不尋常元素的豐度異常高。這些恆星的自轉速度比一般\n  <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/%E6%81%92%E6%98%9F%E5%88%86%E7%B1%BB\" title=\"恒星分类\">\n   A和B型\n  </a>\n  的恆星要慢，雖然仍有一些可以高達≈ 100公里／秒\n  <span class=\"mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline\">\n   <span class=\"mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y\" style=\"display: none;\">\n    <math alttext=\"{\\displaystyle ^{-1}}\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n     <semantics>\n      <mrow class=\"MJX-TeXAtom-ORD\">\n       <mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\">\n        <msup>\n         <mi>\n         </mi>\n         <mrow class=\"MJX-TeXAtom-ORD\">\n          <mo>\n           −\n           <!-- − -->\n          </mo>\n          <mn>\n           1\n          </mn>\n         </mrow>\n        </msup>\n       </mstyle>\n      </mrow>\n      <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n       {\\displaystyle ^{-1}}\n      </annotation>\n     </semantics>\n    </math>\n   </span>\n   <img alt=\"{\\displaystyle ^{-1}}\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert\" src=\"https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/d21ba9ae71e157827da571c142bb49c24b78e1a0\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.171ex; width:2.333ex; height:2.509ex;\"/>\n  </span>\n  。它們也有很強的磁場，有些可以達到 ≈ 4萬\n  <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/%E9%AB%98%E6%96%AF\" title=\"高斯\">\n   G\n  </a>\n  （4\n  <a class=\"new\" href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E6%B3%B0%E6%96%AF%E5%8B%92&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" title=\"泰斯勒（页面不存在）\">\n   T\n  </a>\n  ）。過剩的化學元素在空間中的位置顯示出與磁場的幾何連接。\n有些這一類的恆星會在\n  <a href=\"/wiki/%E5%BE%91%E5%90%91%E9%80%9F%E5%BA%A6\" title=\"徑向速度\">\n   徑向速度\n  </a>\n  上出現數分鐘的脈衝變化。\n研究這些恆星的高解析\n  <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/%E5%85%89%E8%AD%9C\" title=\"光譜\">\n   光譜\n  </a>\n  時，會配合使用研究恆星自轉以推論表面地圖的\n  <a class=\"new\" href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E9%83%BD%E5%8D%9C%E5%8B%92%E6%88%90%E5%83%8F&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" title=\"都卜勒成像（页面不存在）\">\n   都卜勒成像\n  </a>\n  。\n </p>\n <div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\">\n  <h2 id=\"相關條目\">\n   <span id=\".E7.9B.B8.E9.97.9C.E6.A2.9D.E7.9B.AE\">\n   </span>\n   相關條目\n  </h2>\n  <span class=\"mw-editsection\">\n   <span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">\n    [\n   </span>\n   <a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Ap%E5%92%8CBp%E6%98%9F&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"编辑章节：相關條目\">\n    <span>\n     编辑\n    </span>\n   </a>\n   <span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">\n    ]\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </div>\n <ul>\n  <li>\n   <a href=\"/wiki/%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E6%81%86%E6%98%9F\" title=\"特殊恆星\">\n    特殊恆星\n   </a>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n   <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/%E6%81%92%E6%98%9F%E5%88%86%E7%B1%BB\" title=\"恒星分类\">\n    恆星分類\n   </a>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n   <span class=\"ilh-all\" data-foreign-title=\"Doppler imaging\" data-lang-code=\"en\" data-lang-name=\"英语\" data-orig-title=\"都卜勒成像\">\n    <span class=\"ilh-page\">\n     <a class=\"new\" href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E9%83%BD%E5%8D%9C%E5%8B%92%E6%88%90%E5%83%8F&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" title=\"都卜勒成像（页面不存在）\">\n      都卜勒成像\n     </a>\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"noprint ilh-comment\">\n     <span class=\"ilh-paren\">\n      （\n     </span>\n     <span class=\"ilh-lang\">\n      英语\n     </span>\n     <span class=\"ilh-colon\">\n      ：\n     </span>\n     <span class=\"ilh-link\">\n      <a class=\"extiw\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Doppler_imaging\" title=\"en:Doppler imaging\">\n       <span dir=\"auto\" lang=\"en\">\n        Doppler imaging\n       </span>\n      </a>\n     </span>\n     <span class=\"ilh-paren\">\n      ）\n     </span>\n    </span>\n   </span>\n  </li>\n </ul>\n <div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\">\n  <h2 id=\"參考資料\">\n   <span id=\".E5.8F.83.E8.80.83.E8.B3.87.E6.96.99\">\n   </span>\n   參考資料\n  </h2>\n  <span class=\"mw-editsection\">\n   <span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">\n    [\n   </span>\n   <a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Ap%E5%92%8CBp%E6%98%9F&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"编辑章节：參考資料\">\n    <span>\n     编辑\n    </span>\n   </a>\n   <span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">\n    ]\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </div>\n <ol>\n  <li>\n   Gray\n   <a class=\"external text\" href=\"http://cdsads.u-strasbg.fr/abs/2005oasp.book.....G\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    “The Observation and Analysis of Stellar Photospheres”\n   </a>\n   （\n   <a class=\"external text\" href=\"//web.archive.org/web/20110607164849/http://cdsads.u-strasbg.fr/abs/2005oasp.book.....G\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    页面存档备份\n   </a>\n   ，存于\n   <a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BA%92%E8%81%94%E7%BD%91%E6%A1%A3%E6%A1%88%E9%A6%86\" title=\"互联网档案馆\">\n    互联网档案馆\n   </a>\n   ），(2005), Cambridge University Press,\n   <a class=\"internal mw-magiclink-isbn\" href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/0521851866\">\n    ISBN 0521851866\n   </a>\n  </li>\n </ol>\n <!-- \nNewPP limit report\nParsed by mw‐web.eqiad.main‐5b7ddf879c‐nh5pg\nCached time: 20260622053507\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [prevent‐selective‐update]\nCPU time usage: 0.200 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.290 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 226/1000000\nRevision size: 1166/2097152 bytes\nPost‐expand include size: 35392/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 181/2097152 bytes\n